# ── strings ─────────────────────────────────────────────
Remember that name is "  Asiimwe Derick  ".
Remember that clean name is trimmed name.
Show "Hello, " plus clean name plus "!".
Show uppercase of clean name.
Show lowercase of clean name.
Show "letters: " plus length of clean name.
Show "words: " plus number of words in clean name.
Show "first word: " plus first word of clean name.
Show "last word: " plus last word of clean name.
Show "reversed: " plus reverse of "Tooro".
If clean name contains "Derick" then show "it mentions Derick".
If clean name contains "Museveni" then show "wrong" else show "no match".
Show "rounded: " plus round 7.6.

# ── lists ───────────────────────────────────────────────
Remember that districts are a list of "Kyenjojo", "Fort Portal", "Kasese".
Show "number of districts: " plus number of items in districts.
Show "first: " plus first item of districts.
Show "second: " plus item 2 of districts.
Put "Kamwenge" at the end of districts.
Show districts.

Repeat for each place in districts:
  Show uppercase of place plus " is served".
End the repeat.

# ── functions that give values back ─────────────────────
Make a function called interest that takes amount and rate:
  Give back amount times rate divided by 100.
End the function.

Remember that loan is 500000.
Show "interest is " plus the result of interest with loan and 15.
Show "total is " plus loan plus the result of interest with loan and 15.

Make a function called shout that takes text:
  Give back uppercase of text plus "!".
End the function.
Show the result of shout with "tooro music".

Make a function called add up that takes a and b:
  Give back a plus b.
End the function.
Show add up with 5 and 7? 
